      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783167776314,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GoPuff\nGopuff delivers groccries via rapid delivery and 500+ micro distribution centers(DC)\nEg. Blinkit/Zepto",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GoPuff\nGopuff delivers groccries via rapid delivery and 500+ micro distribution centers(DC)\nEg. Blinkit/Zepto",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lrgCR5KLxqqgEJfylflJw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11861.567303531512,
      "y": 28081.343055724086,
      "width": 402.0796813964844,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1642261725,
      "version": 472,
      "versionNonce": 98179539,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783167948628,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- Query availability by location (inside 1H)\n- Order Items\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Can connect to any DC within 1H\n- Fast (100ms) for availability\n- Ordering is strongly consistent\n- 10k DCs, 100k items in catalog\n- Order Volume O(1Mil)/day\n\nOut of Scope\n- Payments\n- Driver routing\n- Search\n- Cancellation and returns",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- Query availability by location (inside 1H)\n- Order Items\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Can connect to any DC within 1H\n- Fast (100ms) for availability\n- Ordering is strongly consistent\n- 10k DCs, 100k items in catalog\n- Order Volume O(1Mil)/day\n\nOut of Scope\n- Payments\n- Driver routing\n- Search\n- Cancellation and returns",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6zDS4QDPtz1U7WyFKYkXQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11852.68006230893,
      "y": 28516.8178756305,
      "width": 204.53982543945312,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
